{
  "title": "【検証】冷蔵庫のメモが必ず「以上。」で終わる件",
  "body": "<div class=\"neko-thread\"><div class=\"neko-res-list\"><div class=\"res\" id=\"res1\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">1：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">1</span> 2011/10/22(土) 17:42:00 ID:A7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">最近うちの冷蔵庫に貼ったメモだけ、翌朝になると全部「以上。」で終わってる。買う物リストにまで付いてる。どう扱えばいい？</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res2\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">2：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">水先案名無い人</span> 2011/10/22(土) 17:43:20 ID:J9dM4qN2</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">まず実物をうp</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res3\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">3：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">1</span> 2011/10/22(土) 17:45:23 ID:A7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">携帯の写真じゃ字が潰れる。『牛乳・卵・以上。』って感じ</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res4\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">4：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">水先案名無い人</span> 2011/10/22(土) 17:48:09 ID:E8mV4pZ1</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">立派な報告書じゃないか</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res5\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">5：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">水先案名無い人</span> 2011/10/22(土) 17:49:07 ID:C9wH3sF6</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">『以上。』のガイドラインを作ろう</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res6\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">6：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">水先案名無い人</span> 2011/10/22(土) 17:50:48 ID:K2vT8fL5</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">ここガ板だしな</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res7\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">7：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">水先案名無い人</span> 2011/10/22(土) 17:53:12 ID:H5sC7yP3</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">誰かが書き足してるの？</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res8\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">8：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">1</span> 2011/10/22(土) 17:56:19 ID:A7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">一人暮らし。合鍵は実家の母だけ</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res9\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">9：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">水先案名無い人</span> 2011/10/22(土) 17:57:38 ID:D2qJ7vK5</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">母ちゃんの仕業で終了</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res10\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">10：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">1</span> 2011/10/22(土) 17:59:40 ID:A7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">母は九州。俺は東京</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res11\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">11：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">水先案名無い人</span> 2011/10/22(土) 18:02:25 ID:J9dM4qN2</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">じゃあ牛乳が書いた</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res12\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">12：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">水先案名無い人</span> 2011/10/22(土) 18:03:22 ID:G6bR2kW8</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">句点まで律儀なのが腹立つ</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res13\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">13：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">水先案名無い人</span> 2011/10/22(土) 18:05:02 ID:E8mV4pZ1</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">筆跡は自分と同じ？</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res14\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">14：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">1</span> 2011/10/22(土) 18:07:25 ID:A7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">微妙に太い。俺は細いペン使う</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res15\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">15：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">水先案名無い人</span> 2011/10/22(土) 18:10:31 ID:K2vT8fL5</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">太いペンが家にあるなら容疑者だ</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res16\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">16：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">1</span> 2011/10/22(土) 18:11:49 ID:A7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">ある。冷蔵庫にくっつけてる</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res17\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">17：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">水先案名無い人</span> 2011/10/22(土) 18:13:50 ID:F3xG9nT6</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">もう犯人の住所わかったな</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res18\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">18：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">1</span> 2011/10/22(土) 18:16:34 ID:A7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\"><a href=\"#res16\">&gt;&gt;16</a> そのペンで勝手に書けるかよ</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res19\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">19：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">水先案名無い人</span> 2011/10/22(土) 18:17:30 ID:B4nT8rL2</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">磁石でペンが動く説</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res20\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">20：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">水先案名無い人</span> 2011/10/22(土) 18:19:09 ID:J9dM4qN2</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">どんな超能力冷蔵庫だ</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res21\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">21：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">水先案名無い人</span> 2011/10/22(土) 18:21:31 ID:G6bR2kW8</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">昨日のメモを取っておけ</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res22\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">22：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">1</span> 2011/10/22(土) 18:24:36 ID:A7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">捨てずに机に置いた</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res23\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">23：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">水先案名無い人</span> 2011/10/22(土) 18:25:53 ID:C9wH3sF6</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">今夜のメモは『洗剤』だけにしてみろ</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res24\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">24：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">水先案名無い人</span> 2011/10/22(土) 18:27:53 ID:K2vT8fL5</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">『以上。』が付けば洗剤の勝利</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res25\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">25：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">水先案名無い人</span> 2011/10/22(土) 18:30:36 ID:H5sC7yP3</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">洗剤を買うのは決定事項なのか</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res26\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">26：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">1</span> 2011/10/22(土) 18:31:31 ID:A7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\"><a href=\"#res23\">&gt;&gt;23</a> 了解。今書いた。写真も撮った</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res27\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">27：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">水先案名無い人</span> 2011/10/22(土) 18:33:09 ID:D2qJ7vK5</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">ペンは別の部屋に置け</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res28\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">28：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">1</span> 2011/10/22(土) 18:35:30 ID:A7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">それもやった</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res29\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">29：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">水先案名無い人</span> 2011/10/22(土) 18:38:34 ID:J9dM4qN2</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">帰宅したら報告してくれ</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res30\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">30：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">水先案名無い人</span> 2011/10/22(土) 18:39:50 ID:G6bR2kW8</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">ところで『以上。』って会社の文書癖？</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res31\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">31：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">1</span> 2011/10/22(土) 18:41:49 ID:A7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">職場の課長がメールの最後に必ず付ける</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res32\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">32：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">水先案名無い人</span> 2011/10/22(土) 18:44:31 ID:C9wH3sF6</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">課長が冷蔵庫に住んでる</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res33\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">33：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">水先案名無い人</span> 2011/10/22(土) 18:45:25 ID:K2vT8fL5</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">家賃取れ</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res34\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">34：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">水先案名無い人</span> 2011/10/22(土) 18:47:02 ID:H5sC7yP3</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">俺は逆に『以下。』って書きたい</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res35\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">35：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">水先案名無い人</span> 2011/10/22(土) 18:49:22 ID:F3xG9nT6</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">冷蔵庫の中に続きを置くのか</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res36\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">36：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">1</span> 2011/10/22(土) 18:52:25 ID:A7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">ちょっと仕事戻る。夜に確認する</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res37\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">37：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">水先案名無い人</span> 2011/10/22(土) 18:53:40 ID:B4nT8rL2</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">続報待ち</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res38\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">38：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">水先案名無い人</span> 2011/10/22(土) 18:55:38 ID:J9dM4qN2</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">課長が犯人だったら面白い</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res39\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">39：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">水先案名無い人</span> 2011/10/22(土) 18:58:19 ID:G6bR2kW8</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">メモが増殖してたらどうする</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res40\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">40：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">1</span> 2011/10/22(土) 18:59:12 ID:A7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">帰宅。『洗剤』の下に『以上。』がある</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res41\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">41：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">水先案名無い人</span> 2011/10/23(日) 00:00:48 ID:C9wH3sF6</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">マジか</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res42\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">42：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">水先案名無い人</span> 2011/10/23(日) 00:03:07 ID:K2vT8fL5</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">ペンは別室だったんだよな</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res43\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">43：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">1</span> 2011/10/23(日) 00:06:09 ID:A7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\"><a href=\"#res27\">&gt;&gt;27</a> そう。引き出しに入れた</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res44\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">44：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">水先案名無い人</span> 2011/10/23(日) 00:07:23 ID:F3xG9nT6</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">なら筆記具が別にある</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"re